      "section_path": [
        "Payslip & Payroll Portal Guide",
        "Access payslips safely"
      ],
      "text": "Open Pay > Payslips and complete step-up MFA if requested. Employees see their own payslips; team managers do not receive payslip access merely through management permissions. Payslips are published on the last business day of each month by 18:00 UTC. A Draft payroll run is not visible in the employee portal. Payment initiation and bank settlement are separate events.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
