      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Payslip & Payroll Portal Guide",
        "Read the statement"
      ],
      "text": "The payroll cutoff is the 20th calendar day at 17:00 UTC. Approvals received later normally appear in the following month's adjustment run. PAY-404 means no published statement exists for that period. PAY-403 means the session lacks access; never ask a colleague to download a statement on your behalf. PAY-EXPORT-017 means an export mapping failed and belongs with Payroll Operations rather than password support.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
