      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Payslip & Payroll Portal Guide",
        "Raise a discrepancy"
      ],
      "text": "Use Pay > Report discrepancy and select the period and line item. Describe the expected rule and link an approval reference where available. Do not include a bank destination in a general ticket field. Payment-destination updates require HR verification and a separate payroll review before cutoff. Payroll Troubleshooting explains allowance mismatches and export retries. A corrected payslip is issued as a new revision; the original remains in the restricted audit history.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
